\f2\b \cf3 The geography fix \'97 do this first
\f3\b0 \cf3 \
The Domain is ground level, by the harbour, inside the Eastern Suburbs bubble \'97 NOT above the Layer. (canon/log) Drop the draft's "up through the Layer" and Cloudborne coming "up." The break-in is sideways and social: the wrong people flooding the meritocracy's own ground-level lawn \'97 the place they're only ever let onto to clean or serve.\

\f2\b \cf3 On Sarah \'97 she doesn't break
\f3\b0 \cf3 \
Sarah is invincible (secret) \'97 nothing here is about her health failing. The high blood pressure is a minor thing Kathy's noted before, not a crisis. Sarah's vulnerability in this scene is entirely feeling, not body. (canon)\

\f2\b \cf3 Step by step \'97 the concert, cut between the people
\f3\b0 \cf3 \
